OL,6,G     First Grand Hotel
OL,7,     FDocumentary following chefs,
OL,8,     Fengineers and hoteliers at the
OL,9,     Fcentral London hotel as they pull
OL,10,     Foff glittering events, luxury
OL,11,     Frenovations and culinary
OL,12,     Fchallenges while battling to
OL,13,     Fensure that the heritage
OL,14,     Fdestination stands out in a
OL,15,     Ffierce-five star market. As Michel
OL,16,     FRoux hosts the biggest dinner of
OL,17,     Fthe year, chef Oliver must manage
OL,18,     Fa culinary crisis, while Alice
OL,19,     Fprepares a #10,000 a night suite
OL,20,     Ffor a demanding guest, and twin
OL,21,     Fengineers Alan and Trevor take a
OL,22,     Fleap of faith to light up the
